This is a PLACEHOLDER, not a binary.

The real WinSW-x64.exe (MIT, https://github.com/winsw/winsw) is NOT committed to
this repository. It is a third-party binary fetched at build/package time and
must be placed in this directory as:

    WinSW-x64.exe

See README.md in this directory for the download URL and verification steps.
No binary is fabricated here on purpose — vendoring an unverified executable
would be a supply-chain risk.
